# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Image datasets
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deliberately untracked. The original scraped dataset is 357 MB of third-party
# stock and press photographs whose licence is recorded as "Unknown" upstream, so
# redistributing it from this repository is a legal exposure independent of the
# machine-learning questions. The Mendeley dataset is CC BY 4.0 and could be
# redistributed with attribution, but at 2.7 GB it belongs in object storage or a
# user's own download rather than in Git history.
#
# docs/DATA.md documents how to obtain each dataset.
data/good/
data/bad/
data/clean/
data/augmented/
data/images/
data/external/
data/processed/

# ...but hand-made annotations ARE tracked. They are small, they took human effort to
# produce, and without them the tread-versus-sidewall experiment cannot be reproduced.
!data/annotations/
!data/annotations/*.json

# Extracted feature tables - regenerable from the datasets
outputs/features/

# Model artifacts. Small enough to track, but a binary blob per training run
# bloats history fast; publish releases instead.
artifacts/*.joblib

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Frontend
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/.env.local
frontend/.env.*.local
# Local-only sample photographs used for manual browser testing. They come from the
# image datasets, which are not redistributable, so they must not be committed - and
# a clean clone simply has no fixtures, which is correct.
frontend/public/__test/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.so
.Python
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.python-version

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tooling
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
coverage.xml
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets and local configuration - never commit these
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local tooling
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local editor/tooling scratch state and worktrees - not project configuration.
.claude/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS and editor
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
